TITLE: NgZone API Compatibility in Zoneless Angular
DESCRIPTION: Certain `NgZone` observables and properties, such as `onMicrotaskEmpty`, `onUnstable`, `onStable`, and `isStable`, become non-functional in zoneless applications and must be removed or replaced. However, `NgZone.run` and `NgZone.runOutsideAngular` remain compatible and should not be removed to avoid performance regressions in applications still relying on ZoneJS.
SOURCE: https://angular.dev/guide/zoneless

LANGUAGE: APIDOC
CODE:

```
NgZone APIs to Remove/Replace in Zoneless Applications:
- NgZone.onMicrotaskEmpty: Replace with `afterNextRender` or `afterEveryRender`.
- NgZone.onUnstable: Remove.
- NgZone.onStable: Replace with `afterNextRender` or `afterEveryRender`.
- NgZone.isStable: Always `true`, do not use as a condition for code execution.

NgZone APIs Compatible with Zoneless Applications:
- NgZone.run
- NgZone.runOutsideAngular
```

